    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs7vAQVz",
      "title": "ops: bump optimism dependency",
      "author": "mds1",
      "number": 1279,
      "body": "Bumps `ops` to the optimism commit from ethereum-optimism/optimism#21625 so registry automation picks up the updated `op-fetcher` artifacts.\n\nLeaving this draft for now because the bumped optimism pseudo-version currently fails Go module consumption:\n\n```text\nGONOSUMDB=github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism go test ./...\n# /Users/mds/go/pkg/mod/github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism@v1.19.3-0.20260706204718-7ae3e5682084/op-core/superchain/chain.go:20:12: pattern superchain-configs.zip: no matching files found\n```\n\nThat zip exists in my local optimism checkout, but is gitignored and absent from commit `7ae3e56820845529f35ad3700b555b32ba77ce1e`, while `op-core/superchain/chain.go` embeds it. This should become mergeable once the upstream optimism PR/module packaging issue is fixed.\n\nValidation:\n- `GONOSUMDB=github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism go mod tidy`\n- `GONOSUMDB=github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism go work sync`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `GONOSUMDB=github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism go test ./...` (fails as above)\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-07T20:45:55Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 81,
      "deletions": 57
    },
